WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:02.560
The matter of Yu Gong

00:02.720 --> 00:04.720
Will be handled as you wish

00:05.240 --> 00:06.160
Your son

00:06.240 --> 00:07.440
Thanks Father

00:07.520 --> 00:08.440
Second son

00:08.520 --> 00:10.000
You think carefully and act prudently

00:10.080 --> 00:12.413
Always trying to be thorough in everything

00:12.680 --> 00:14.560
But you're also too indecisive

00:14.960 --> 00:17.200
I have a word of warning for you

